sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Producer app
    participant SQS as SQS queue
    participant W as Relay worker
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Brevo as Brevo API

    App->>SQS: SendMessage(project_id attribute, template_key, to, payload)
    W->>SQS: ReceiveMessage (long poll, one configured queue)
    SQS-->>W: message + ReceiptHandle
    W->>W: parse JSON and project_id attribute
    W->>DB: load Project + active Template
    W->>DB: insert Message(status=pending)
    W->>W: validate schema and render subject/html
    W->>DB: update Message(status=processing, attempts += 1)
    W->>Brevo: send email
    alt success
        Brevo-->>W: 201 + provider_message_id
        W->>DB: update Message(status=sent)
        W->>SQS: DeleteMessage
        Note over W,SQS: Crash before DeleteMessage causes redelivery and duplicate send.
    else failure
        Brevo-->>W: error
        W->>DB: update Message(status=failed, last_error)
        Note over W,SQS: Message remains; retry creates another Message row.\nDLQ only exists if external redrive policy is configured.
    end

    alt malformed or render/database error
        W-->>W: exception outside handled classes may stop worker
        Note over W,SQS: malformed input is not recorded before parse;\nrender failure can leave pending row.
    end
